OL,5,G2350 Soldier: For King and Country
OL,6,     FThe Royal Welsh Regiment's most
OL,7,     Fsenior officer, Lieutenant Colonel
OL,8,     FOliver Beard, must prove himself
OL,9,     Fon the battlefield as a Warrior
OL,10,     Fgunner if he is to lead his
OL,11,     Fsoldiers into war. (Ep2/4)
OL,12,G0050 Platoon 24/7: Preparing for War
OL,13,     FWe follow every moment over six
OL,14,     Fgruelling months as a platoon
OL,15,     Fprepares for possible frontline
OL,16,     Fdeployment. A Band of Brothers who
OL,17,     Fwould lay down their lives for
OL,18,     Feach other.
